<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-08-19T16:39:30+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:39:30 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[In 1964, a 27-year-old woman bought an abandoned Maine island and lived alone; 22 years later, it became a wildlife sanctuary]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133345760.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Witch Island, previously inhabited by the infamous Anna Chittenden—referred to as the 'Witch of Wall Street'—has transformed into a wildlife sanctuary. After her brief stay, Jane Sewall took on the responsibility of safeguarding the isle from irresponsible tourists. In 1986, Sewall gifted the island to the Maine Audubon Society, which is now overseen by the Coastal Rivers Conservation Trust.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1964-a-27-year-old-woman-bought-an-abandoned-18-acre-island-off-maine-and-built-a-small-house-to-live-there-alone-22-years-later-the-island-was-donated-to-become-a-wildlife-sanctuary/articleshow/133345760.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1964-a-27-year-old-woman-bought-an-abandoned-18-acre-island-off-maine-and-built-a-small-house-to-live-there-alone-22-years-later-the-island-was-donated-to-become-a-wildlife-sanctuary/articleshow/133345760.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T16:29:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133345998,imgsize-276083.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by George Soros: "I'm only rich because I know when I'm wrong... I basically have survived by…"]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133344542.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-george-soros-im-only-rich-because-i-know-when-im-wrong-i-basically-have-survived-by-why-admitting-mistakes-can-lead-to-success/articleshow/133344542.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-george-soros-im-only-rich-because-i-know-when-im-wrong-i-basically-have-survived-by-why-admitting-mistakes-can-lead-to-success/articleshow/133344542.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T15:49:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133344747,imgsize-88776.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[What happened to TikTok star Ayesha Gilamana who died at 28? Everything we know as police detain 3 suspects]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133344281.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Tragedy struck when TikTok sensation Ayesha Gilamana, popularly known as Shamsu Bibi, was shot and killed while driving. Assailants on a motorcycle opened fire, leading to a crash involving her vehicle. Ayesha's younger sister was injured in the wreck and is now receiving treatment. Authorities have arrested three suspects believed to be related to the attackers, as investigations continue to uncover the motive behind this shocking incident.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/what-happened-to-tiktok-star-ayesha-gilamana-who-died-at-28-everything-we-know-as-police-detain-3-suspects/articleshow/133344281.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/what-happened-to-tiktok-star-ayesha-gilamana-who-died-at-28-everything-we-know-as-police-detain-3-suspects/articleshow/133344281.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T15:31:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133344334,imgsize-48920.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1943, Franklin Delano Roosevelt gave Springwood and 33 acres to US; estate had 1,500 acres and 500,000 trees]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133343730.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[President Franklin D. Roosevelt generously bequeathed his family's Springwood estate to the government, substantially enhancing the property throughout his life. By planting over 500,000 trees, Roosevelt transformed the surrounding landscape. This pivotal donation secured the lasting preservation of this notable presidential site, which became both America’s first presidential library and a cherished national historic landmark.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1943-franklin-roosevelt-gave-his-family-home-and-33-acres-to-the-us-government-while-retaining-family-rights-to-live-there-he-had-expanded-the-estate-to-nearly-1500-acres-and-planted-over-500000-trees/articleshow/133343730.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1943-franklin-roosevelt-gave-his-family-home-and-33-acres-to-the-us-government-while-retaining-family-rights-to-live-there-he-had-expanded-the-estate-to-nearly-1500-acres-and-planted-over-500000-trees/articleshow/133343730.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T15:13:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133343838,imgsize-1035291.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Harvard to pay Rs 507 crore settlement after morgue manager stole, sold donated body parts]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133344535.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/harvard-to-pay-rs-507-crore-settlement-after-morgue-manager-stole-sold-donated-body-parts/articleshow/133344535.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/harvard-to-pay-rs-507-crore-settlement-after-morgue-manager-stole-sold-donated-body-parts/articleshow/133344535.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T15:43:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133344649,imgsize-83863.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[FBI puts Indian national Major Singh on Most Wanted list]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133343588.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/fbi-puts-indian-national-major-singh-on-most-wanted-list/articleshow/133343588.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/fbi-puts-indian-national-major-singh-on-most-wanted-list/articleshow/133343588.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T15:07:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133343746,imgsize-308828.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet Kanav Jain: Scottish student who built a low-cost autonomous aircraft to deliver medicines to remote communities]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133343547.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Kanav Jain, a talented Scottish student, has been awarded the prestigious UK Young Engineer of the Year for creating AeroAid, an innovative low-cost autonomous drone aimed at delivering medical supplies. This versatile VTOL quadplane combines the best features of helicopters and airplanes, making it ideal for reaching remote locations. Jain’s mission is to leverage technology for vital humanitarian assistance, reflecting his commitment as a leader in drone technology workshops.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/meet-kanav-jain-the-scottish-student-who-built-a-low-cost-autonomous-aircraft-to-deliver-medicines-to-remote-communities-it-made-him-uk-young-engineer-of-the-year/articleshow/133343547.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/meet-kanav-jain-the-scottish-student-who-built-a-low-cost-autonomous-aircraft-to-deliver-medicines-to-remote-communities-it-made-him-uk-young-engineer-of-the-year/articleshow/133343547.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T15:01:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133343609,imgsize-121771.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Spanish woman trains 18 rescued donkeys to help prevent wildfires]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133328932.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/a-spanish-woman-turned-18-rescued-donkeys-into-a-wildfire-fighting-team-with-the-animals-grazing-for-up-to-7-hours-a-day-her-unusual-conservation-idea-is-helping-prevent-fires-before-they-start/articleshow/133328932.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/a-spanish-woman-turned-18-rescued-donkeys-into-a-wildfire-fighting-team-with-the-animals-grazing-for-up-to-7-hours-a-day-her-unusual-conservation-idea-is-helping-prevent-fires-before-they-start/articleshow/133328932.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T15:01:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133328994,imgsize-214753.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Queen Camilla says she nearly revealed King Charles III’s cancer diagnosis]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133342897.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/queen-camilla-says-she-nearly-revealed-king-charles-iiis-cancer-diagnosis-days-before-palace-announcement/articleshow/133342897.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/queen-camilla-says-she-nearly-revealed-king-charles-iiis-cancer-diagnosis-days-before-palace-announcement/articleshow/133342897.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T14:34:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133343062,imgsize-662532.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Between 1969 and 1972, US released a weevil to fight musk thistle; it later attacked native thistles]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133342649.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A biological control initiative aimed at managing invasive thistles integrated a weevil specifically targeting musk thistle. Unfortunately, this insect extended its reach to native plant species, leading to detrimental effects on local thistles, including an endangered variety that experienced a decline in seed production. This situation underscores the critical importance of careful evaluation in invasive species control programs.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/between-1969-and-1972-the-us-released-a-european-weevil-to-fight-invasive-musk-thistle-it-later-attacked-at-least-25-native-thistles-including-rare-and-endangered-species/articleshow/133342649.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/between-1969-and-1972-the-us-released-a-european-weevil-to-fight-invasive-musk-thistle-it-later-attacked-at-least-25-native-thistles-including-rare-and-endangered-species/articleshow/133342649.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T14:25:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133342751,imgsize-1670890.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A 2,500-year-old sacred well in Italy hid bronze offerings and two human skeletons]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133342462.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Archaeologists found an unusual ritual well at ancient Etruscan city Kainua in Italy.  Two bronze statuettes and a rare bronze plate were discovered at the well's bottom.  These objects were votive offerings placed during a foundation ritual centuries ago.  Two adult human skeletons were also found, marking the structure's ritual closing.  The findings offer new insights into Etruscan city foundations and religious traditions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/a-2500-year-old-sacred-well-in-italy-hid-bronze-offerings-and-two-human-skeletons-from-an-ancient-etruscan-ritual/articleshow/133342462.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/a-2500-year-old-sacred-well-in-italy-hid-bronze-offerings-and-two-human-skeletons-from-an-ancient-etruscan-ritual/articleshow/133342462.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T14:14:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133342567,imgsize-230431.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump claims over 24,000 noncitizens voted illegally in 2020]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133342086.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-claims-over-24000-noncitizens-voted-illegally-in-2020/articleshow/133342086.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-claims-over-24000-noncitizens-voted-illegally-in-2020/articleshow/133342086.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T14:10:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133342405,imgsize-66298.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Disney built Disneyland around a family farm that refused a $90 million offer]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133322553.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[For decades, the Fujishige family refused to sell their 58-acre farm in Anaheim, even as Disneyland and surrounding development transformed the area. Disney and other developers made repeated offers for the valuable land, but the family continued growing strawberries and vegetables. After years of pressure and a bitter fight with the city, the family finally agreed to sell in 1998, shortly before Hiroshi Fujishige died. The former farm later became the Toy Story parking lot at Disneyland.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1953-a-california-family-bought-a-58-acre-berry-farm-for-3500-decades-later-they-reportedly-refused-a-90-million-offer-from-disney-and-kept-farming-beside-disneyland/articleshow/133322553.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1953-a-california-family-bought-a-58-acre-berry-farm-for-3500-decades-later-they-reportedly-refused-a-90-million-offer-from-disney-and-kept-farming-beside-disneyland/articleshow/133322553.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-19T14:19:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133324379,imgsize-134375.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US soldiers hid a time capsule inside a barracks wall before deploying to Iraq]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133338775.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2004-us-soldiers-hid-a-time-capsule-inside-a-barracks-wall-before-deploying-to-iraq-and-19-years-later-contractors-found-it-during-renovations/article